  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFFIm frontloading for CEPI og Covid-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFFIm issues Covid19 Vaccine Bonds in the capital markets and repay these bonds with long-term donor pledges. IFFIm will frontload pledges made by the Norwegian Government to CEPI in 2021-2030, for the use in the years 2020-2021. CEPI is a partnership of public, private and humanitarian organizations. The Coalition will fund/stimulate development of vaccines against Covid19, and will work with partners to ensure equitable access to these vaccines.</narrative>
  </description>
